Lab 3: Installing and Configuring IdM Replica
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure an Identity Management (IdM) replica server for high availability
Establish replication between the primary IdM server and replica
Verify and monitor replication status between IdM servers
Understand the benefits of IdM replication for enterprise environments
Troubleshoot common replication issues
