Why This Matters
IdM replication is crucial for enterprise environments because it:

Ensures Business Continuity: If the primary server fails, the replica can continue serving authentication requests
Improves Performance: Multiple servers can handle authentication loads, reducing response times
Provides Geographic Distribution: Replicas can be placed in different locations to serve remote users efficiently
Enhances Disaster Recovery: Multiple copies of identity data protect against data loss
